1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 3=

10
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:01,950
My lady.

11
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:03,660
Get out! You too!

12
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:05,660
What good are you
if you're the Deputy Director

13
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,710
of the Imperial Medical Service?

14
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,580
Fine. I'm going.

15
00:01:11,310 --> 00:01:11,940
I'm going right now.

16
00:01:12,230 --> 00:01:14,150
If you can't bring back a physician,
don't bother coming back!

17
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:21,540
Master!

18
00:01:22,150 --> 00:01:23,590
The owner of Jishitang Apothecary
is here to see you.

19
00:01:33,670 --> 00:01:34,350
Lord Zhao.

20
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,180
I've recently heard

21
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,980
that someone has been secretly investigating
our medicinal herb smuggling.

22
00:01:39,430 --> 00:01:41,470
I hear it's the medical attendant
treating Concubine Liu.

23
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:44,940
Lord Zhao, I suggest you
deal with this matter quickly.

24
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:48,260
(If I can't make use of you,)

25
00:01:49,220 --> 00:01:51,300
(then keeping you alive
will only spell trouble.)

26
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:55,540
The owner of Jishitang Apothecary
met with Zhao Wujiu in secret.

27
00:01:55,830 --> 00:01:58,350
I fear he may have
caught on to what we're doing.

28
00:01:58,670 --> 00:01:59,580
I've already won over

29
00:01:59,580 --> 00:02:02,180
three women who were abused
and humiliated by Zhao Wujiu.

30
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,260
We'll join forces

31
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:04,420
and follow your lead.

32
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:07,830
We need to act before he does.

33
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:09,660
(Imperial Medical Service)

34
00:02:09,670 --> 00:02:12,830
Concubine Liu has been bedridden

35
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,310
ever since she took
Gu Hanyi's Nourishing Vitality Pill.

36
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:17,230
There must be something
suspicious about this.

37
00:02:18,870 --> 00:02:21,750
I may have recommended Gu Hanyi
to the Imperial Medical Service,

38
00:02:21,980 --> 00:02:24,590
but she is calculating and her
medical methods are unpredictable.

39
00:02:24,590 --> 00:02:25,670
She's difficult to control.

40
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:26,750
If we continue to let her have her way,

41
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:29,050
she'll eventually
become a serious threat.

42
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:31,830
But Gu Hanyi has close ties
with Censor Zheng's family.

43
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:34,590
Miss Zheng
even treats her like a sister.

44
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:37,470
She's highly regarded right now.

45
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:39,260
If we make a move against her now,

46
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:41,780
we may only
bring trouble upon ourselves.

47
00:02:43,110 --> 00:02:43,980
We can't move against her openly.

48
00:02:44,830 --> 00:02:46,750
Then we'll get rid of her in secret.

49
00:02:51,830 --> 00:02:54,670
I've obtained part
of a prescription she wrote today.

50
00:02:55,510 --> 00:02:58,180
There are traces of something on it
that shouldn't be there.

51
00:03:11,390 --> 00:03:12,070
Red lead.

52
00:03:13,630 --> 00:03:16,300
It's a highly toxic substance
expressly forbidden in the palace.

53
00:03:16,510 --> 00:03:17,420
(Prescription)
It is extremely toxic and produces intense heat.

54
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:18,390
Exactly.

55
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:22,420
Doesn't Gu Hanyi pride herself
on being a benevolent physician

56
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:24,140
and offer free treatment to the poor?

57
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:27,180
What if someone reports that she
used red lead in her medicine

58
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:28,380
and poisoned innocent people,

59
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:32,350
even causing an official's wife
to lose her unborn child?

60
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:33,630
Tell me,

61
00:03:33,950 --> 00:03:36,550
would Censor Zheng
still be able to protect her?

62
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:39,230
We are willing to testify together

63
00:03:39,830 --> 00:03:42,070
that she abused a banned substance
and recklessly endangered lives.

64
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:45,190
We can arrange
both the witnesses and the evidence.

65
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:47,140
Master!

66
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:48,580
Master!

67
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:50,700
Something terrible has happened!

68
00:03:51,830 --> 00:03:53,790
Concubine Liu died suddenly.

69
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:54,510
What?

70
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:55,950
How could this happen?

71
00:03:56,580 --> 00:03:57,580
How could this be?

72
00:04:01,390 --> 00:04:02,670
She was perfectly fine yesterday.

73
00:04:03,070 --> 00:04:04,670
How did she end up like this overnight?

74
00:04:12,630 --> 00:04:13,140
Lord Zhao.

75
00:04:14,070 --> 00:04:16,020
She has no pulse
and rigor mortis has set in.

76
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:17,140
There is discoloration
around her mouth and nose.

77
00:04:17,910 --> 00:04:19,420
These are signs of poisoning.

78
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:21,860
Test the Nourishing Vitality Pill.

79
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:22,460
Yes.

80
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:52,260
(You vile concubine,
how did the red lead taste?)

81
00:04:57,350 --> 00:04:57,910
Sir.

82
00:04:59,540 --> 00:05:00,580
There appears to be
a mild toxin in the medicine.

83
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:01,950
It can cause weakness,

84
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:03,980
but it isn't enough to be fatal.

85
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:06,910
Just say what you found.

86
00:05:07,980 --> 00:05:10,070
While examining Madam earlier,

87
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:12,260
I found some residue in her bowl.

88
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:14,580
It was red lead.

89
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:16,070
Red lead?

90
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:16,750
Yes.

91
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:24,950
Spread the word immediately.

92
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:27,750
Concubine Liu died after taking
Gu Hanyi's poisonous pills.

93
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:29,510
Make sure this causes a huge uproar.

94
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:30,550
Yes.

95
00:05:31,310 --> 00:05:33,260
I want everyone in the Capital to know

96
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:36,660
that I, Zhao Wujiu, am the victim
who lost his beloved concubine.

97
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:39,020
I want to see

98
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:42,100
just what Gu Hanyi is really hiding,

99
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:43,510
a venomous snake or a vicious beast.

100
00:05:44,340 --> 00:05:46,460
Master, then Gu Hanyi...

101
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:47,900
Report her to the authorities at once.

102
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:48,990
Yes, Master.

103
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:56,340
(Court of Judicial Review)

104
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:12,510
Are you Gu Hanyi?

105
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:13,220
Sir.

106
00:06:13,870 --> 00:06:15,020
I, Gu Hanyi, an official
of the Imperial Medical Service,

107
00:06:15,460 --> 00:06:17,660
hereby accuse Deputy Director Zhao Wujiu
of the Imperial Medical Service

108
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:20,070
of embezzling medicinal herbs
and hoarding banned substances,

109
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,260
colluding with corrupt merchants,

110
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:23,950
smuggling imperial medicinal herbs
for personal profit,

111
00:06:24,550 --> 00:06:26,580
and even profiting from dangerous
substances such as red lead,

112
00:06:27,660 --> 00:06:28,550
which have poisoned pregnant women.

113
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:30,020
The evidence is conclusive.

114
00:06:31,870 --> 00:06:32,630
Please judge this case fairly, Sir.

115
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:34,820
This woman is making false accusations!

116
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,830
She's the one who used red lead
to poison innocent people.

117
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:38,870
I have evidence.

118
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:43,430
Sir.

119
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:48,190
These are Zhao Wujiu's
transaction records

120
00:06:48,390 --> 00:06:50,460
with Jishitang Apothecary
in the west of the Capital.

121
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,430
They clearly show

122
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:53,999
how he secretly diverted
valuable medicinal herbs

123
00:06:53,999 --> 00:06:55,410
from the Imperial Medical Service.

124
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:56,950
Among them

125
00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:59,310
were banned substances expressly
prohibited from public circulation.

126
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:02,220
These are the signed testimonies
of those involved.

127
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:12,700
Furthermore,

128
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,430
he abused his position

129
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:16,070
to secretly hoard red lead
and other substances,

130
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:20,020
then sold them to unsuspecting officials
and wealthy families,

131
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:23,070
causing several pregnant women
to die from severe hemorrhaging.

132
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:24,660
And here

133
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:27,660
are the victims' families'
anguished statements.

134
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,380
(Wu Ming)

135
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:32,870
Zhao Wujiu ordered his men
to spread rumors

136
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:34,390
and frame me.

137
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:35,100
Our investigation has confirmed

138
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:36,750
that he abused his authority
over medicinal herb procurement

139
00:07:36,750 --> 00:07:37,660
for the Imperial Medical Service

140
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:39,460
and colluded
with medicine merchants in the Capital

141
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:40,940
to pass off inferior goods
as quality supplies

142
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:42,020
- and pocket the profits.
- Sir.

143
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:45,510
He favored his concubines over his wife
and indulged in debauchery.

144
00:07:45,660 --> 00:07:46,700
- He abducted innocent women.
- Come here.

145
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:48,610
He had innocent people imprisoned
on false charges,

146
00:07:48,610 --> 00:07:49,610
leading to their wrongful deaths.

147
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:51,580
Zhao Wujiu.

148
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:55,070
- You will pay for every vile deed
- Sir, they're here to arrest me!

149
00:07:55,550 --> 00:07:56,510
you've committed.

150
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:58,860
(Ledger)

151
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,510
Here.

152
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:02,340
Over here.

153
00:08:03,550 --> 00:08:04,310
Gu Hanyi.

154
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,020
You dare accuse me first
when you're the guilty one!

155
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:08,630
Concubine Liu died of poisoning

156
00:08:08,630 --> 00:08:09,750
after taking your
Nourishing Vitality Pill.

157
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,750
You want to frame me?

158
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:13,310
Don't you know who's backing me?

159
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:14,220
Sir.

160
00:08:14,310 --> 00:08:14,870
Sir.

161
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:16,830
I, Zheng Shu,

162
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:18,430
can testify on behalf
of Medical Attendant Gu.

163
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:22,460
Sir.

164
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:25,260
Zhao Wujiu repeatedly made
improper advances toward my father

165
00:08:25,550 --> 00:08:26,260
for his own illicit purposes.

166
00:08:26,990 --> 00:08:28,580
When my father refused, he bore a grudge

167
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:30,990
and joined forces with his colleagues
to impeach my father without cause.

168
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:33,510
This man has malicious intentions.

169
00:08:34,070 --> 00:08:35,430
Nothing he says can be trusted.

170
00:08:36,390 --> 00:08:38,140
Medical Attendant Gu
is a compassionate physician

171
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:39,510
who saved my life.

172
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:41,310
She would never
misuse banned substances.

173
00:08:46,190 --> 00:08:47,220
Poisoning pregnant women

174
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:48,460
is an unforgivable crime.

175
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:50,950
He even killed the woman
who shared his bed.

176
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:52,830
He's worse than a beast.

177
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:54,990
Silence!

178
00:08:56,660 --> 00:08:57,190
Sir.

179
00:08:57,630 --> 00:08:59,340
The sudden death
of his concubine, Concubine Liu,

180
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:00,830
was not my doing.

181
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:03,660
Zhao Wujiu's abuse of red lead

182
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:04,550
was about to be exposed,

183
00:09:04,580 --> 00:09:05,390
so he framed someone else
to save himself.

184
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:08,510
His intentions are vicious, and his crimes
deserve the harshest punishment.

185
00:09:09,870 --> 00:09:12,140
This case involves banned substances
and multiple deaths.

186
00:09:12,700 --> 00:09:13,660
It is beyond our authority to decide.

187
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,340
We must report it
to the imperial court at once.

188
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:16,700
Gu Hanyi.

189
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:19,100
If even a word
of your testimony is false,

190
00:09:19,340 --> 00:09:20,950
you will be guilty of falsely accusing
an imperial official,

191
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:22,020
and your punishment
will be even more severe.

192
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:24,830
Do you dare sign a sworn statement?

193
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:26,140
Sir.

194
00:09:27,190 --> 00:09:29,310
I swear on my life

195
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:31,310
that every word I've said is true.

196
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:35,150
I ask you to judge with fairness
and clear the innocent

197
00:09:35,430 --> 00:09:36,670
of these false charges.

198
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:52,150
Zhao Wujiu.

199
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:55,460
You hoarded banned substances
and harmed young girls,

200
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:58,550
poisoned pregnant women,
and murdered your concubine.

201
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:01,830
The evidence is conclusive,
and your crimes are unforgivable.

202
00:10:02,460 --> 00:10:04,950
You are hereby stripped of office
and condemned to death.

203
00:10:05,430 --> 00:10:08,500
You will be executed
at the marketplace at noon tomorrow.

204
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,390
Lord Zhao.

205
00:10:12,950 --> 00:10:13,740
Gu Hanyi!

206
00:10:14,430 --> 00:10:15,670
You vicious woman!

207
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:18,580
You think this is
enough to bring me down?

208
00:10:19,430 --> 00:10:20,740
Look at you now, Lord Zhao.

209
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:22,430
Why hasn't the man behind you

210
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:25,830
come to save you?

211
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:29,430
Someone will come for me.

212
00:10:30,430 --> 00:10:31,790
Once I'm out,

213
00:10:32,430 --> 00:10:34,670
I'll make you suffer a thousand cuts!

214
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:41,070
Once you've outlived your usefulness,
you'll be discarded.

215
00:10:41,670 --> 00:10:43,670
Surely you don't still believe

216
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:46,220
that Grand Secretary Cui Hong

217
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:48,500
would keep a discarded pawn
like you alive?

218
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:51,550
Who are you?

219
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:13,480
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

220
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:17,180
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

221
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:20,660
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

222
00:11:21,510 --> 00:11:24,500
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

223
00:11:25,350 --> 00:11:28,670
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

224
00:11:29,010 --> 00:11:32,300
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

225
00:11:32,650 --> 00:11:39,130
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

226
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:47,010
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

227
00:11:49,510 --> 00:11:57,360
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

228
00:11:57,660 --> 00:11:59,470
♪I stand here today♪

229
00:11:59,610 --> 00:12:04,120
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

230
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:11,610
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

231
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:13,540
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

232
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:15,940
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

233
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:23,230
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
